			"date": "2024-12-16T15:27:43.915Z",
			"content": "<p>At the brochure-site level everything is design driven. Progressive enhancement means that sometimes it won't look like what we sold the client. That's a tough thing to explain up.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:f64vb5rx6mqokvtn3gbgtnkv/app.bsky.feed.post/3ldgniigy622h",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scottjehl.com/post/3ldgniigy622h",
			"author": {
				"name": "Scott Jehl",
