				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:wjzw74n44kuehrcwoqerbuvn/bafkreifxvjlj3ymm4p7tfugtjnylsepgvflqzwa347mx3abzogtqs4lfaq"
			},
			"date": "2024-12-16T15:33:20.482Z",
			"content": "<p>They think \"don’t use React\" means \"don’t use JavaScript\" because they never learned or they forgot how to do JS without React. They think React == JS.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
